; orchard_mill_town.room - Vila dos Moinhos (design 04 section 3.6): a flat main street from the terraces (east) to the leaf path (west); inn door at col 30.
; Soltar on the inn gallery (row 2) drops the drawbridge 18 cells east to the stone mill loft, nine rows above the yard and beyond every
